  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.9 - Robustness and layout-correctness release. Recursion-depth hardening across the HTML parser, layout builder, SVG structure walk and render path so adversarially nested documents are truncated with a reported diagnostic instead of overflowing the stack; new LayoutDiagnostics channel on ConversionResult surfacing parse-flattening and depth truncation. CSS custom properties: case-sensitive property names, var() cycle detection, and expansion bounds. Inline layout fixes for separator spacing, glue consistency, line-box height and ::first-letter. Table pagination fixes for repeating tfoot and cell-row page breaks. Malformed-HTML recovery, over-wide element scaling, viewport isolation, image presentational attributes, and block-level link annotations. Bundled Noto symbol-glyph subsets for deterministic symbol rendering. Box-model and fragmentation correctness: backgrounds and square borders now paint at the BORDER box (CSS Backgrounds 3 background-clip initial value), stretched flex items no longer overshoot their container by both border widths, the border-style longhand is applied, border-style:hidden paints nothing, and thin/medium/thick resolve to 1px/3px/5px per CSS Backgrounds 3 3.3 (previously 1/3/5pt, ~33% too thick) including column-rule. Elliptical border-radius (the '/' form) renders both axes. break-before/break-after are honoured on table rows, repeating the thead onto the page the break opens. Flex fixes for row-reverse auto margins and column-axis flex-end alignment. BEHAVIOUR CHANGE: documents using the border-style longhand, border-style:hidden, the border-width keywords, or table row breaks will render differently to 1.0.8. Previous 1.0.x notes remain in git history.",
